Package: irate-box
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: NomDeTom <NomDeTom@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), curl, ca-certificates, git, unzip, fcgiwrap, cgit, iw, openssl, gpgv
Recommends: nginx | caddy, kiwix-tools
Suggests: syncthing, mosquitto, mosquitto-clients, nodejs
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/NomDeTom/irate-box
Description: offline hub for a small board, in the spirit of PirateBox
 A shoutbox, a board, a file drop, drawing and diagram tools, an offline library,
 git servers and more, served by the box itself to whoever joins its network, with
 no internet needed. Admin pages run the box: add-ons, who can open each app,
 updates, and doctors for the services, security and updates.
 .
 Installing the package does not set the box up: run sudo irate-box-setup.
